<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="418550450"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1876132444"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="WILD"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Troye Sivan / Alessia Cara"/><amll:meta key="album" value="WILD"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:39.492"><div begin="00:00.000" end="03:31.872"><p begin="00:00.000" end="00:02.002" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37332">(Wi-i-i-ild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为你疯狂</span></p><p begin="00:02.549" end="00:04.405" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37333">Wi-i-i-ild</p><p begin="00:04.415" end="00:04.971" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37334">Hey)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">竭尽全力只为不再沦陷</span></p><p begin="00:04.981" end="00:06.972" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37335">Trying hard not to fall</p><p begin="00:07.995" end="00:09.305" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37336">On the way home<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回家的旅途中</span></p><p begin="00:09.415" end="00:11.726" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37337">You were trying to wear me down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你努力让我心灰意冷</span></p><p begin="00:11.968" end="00:13.089" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37338">Down</p><p begin="00:14.664" end="00:17.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37339">Kissing up on fences and up on walls<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在围栏边拥吻对方</span></p><p begin="00:18.256" end="00:19.558" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37340">On the way home<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回家的旅途中</span></p><p begin="00:19.568" end="00:22.248" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37341">I guess it's all working out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我猜想我们还是有可能的</span></p><p begin="00:22.276" end="00:23.449" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37342">Now</p><p begin="00:24.542" end="00:25.729" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37343">'Cause there's still<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为现在离周末还太遥远</span></p><p begin="00:25.739" end="00:27.757" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37344">Too long to the weekend</p><p begin="00:27.767" end="00:29.514" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37345">Too long till I drown in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还要那么久才能牵起你的手</span></p><p begin="00:29.524" end="00:30.677" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37346">Your hands</p><p begin="00:30.687" end="00:33.364" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37347">Too long since I've been a fool<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我已像个傻瓜般对你深深眷恋</span></p><p begin="00:34.026" end="00:35.685" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37348">Oh, yeah</p><p begin="00:35.923" end="00:38.237" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37349">Leave this blue neighborhood<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多想离开这痛苦的悲伤之地</span></p><p begin="00:38.247" end="00:40.993" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37350">Never knew loving could hurt this good, oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从不知爱会让人如此受伤</span></p><p begin="00:41.639" end="00:43.563" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37351">And it drives me wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它让我失去理智 全然疯狂</span></p><p begin="00:46.082" end="00:48.355" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37352">'Cause when you look like that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为当你是那般模样时</span></p><p begin="00:48.365" end="00:51.287" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37353">I've never ever wanted to be so bad, oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心对你燃起从未有过的渴望</span></p><p begin="00:51.890" end="00:54.090" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37354">Yeah, it drives me wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它让我失去理智 全然疯狂</span></p><p begin="00:55.095" end="01:00.264" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37355">You're driving me wild, wild, wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我失去理智 为你疯狂</span></p><p begin="01:00.281" end="01:04.531" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37356">You're driving me wild, wild, wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我失去理智 为你疯狂</span></p><p begin="01:04.878" end="01:06.787" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37357">You're driving me wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我失去理智</span></p><p begin="01:06.317" end="01:08.533" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37358">(Wi-i-i-ild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为你疯狂</span></p><p begin="01:08.951" end="01:10.768" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37359">Wi-i-i-ild</p><p begin="01:10.778" end="01:11.442" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37360">Hey)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们那么的相似 你和我</span></p><p begin="01:11.598" end="01:13.064" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37361">We're alike, you and I</p><p begin="01:14.316" end="01:18.484" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37362">Two blue hearts locked in our wrong minds<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两颗伤痕累累的心彼此紧闭</span></p><p begin="01:20.934" end="01:23.361" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37363">So can we make the most outta no time?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能否将不可能变成可能</span></p><p begin="01:24.465" end="01:26.067" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37365">Can you hold me?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能否紧拥我？</span></p><p begin="01:26.344" end="01:31.405" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37366">Can you make me leave my demons and my broken pieces behind?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能否让我远离邪恶的心</span></p><p begin="01:31.373" end="01:32.039" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37368">'Cause there's still<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为现在</span></p><p begin="01:32.049" end="01:33.916" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37369">Too long till the weekend<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">离周末还太遥远</span></p><p begin="01:33.926" end="01:35.927" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37370">Too long till I drown in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还要那么久才能牵起你的手</span></p><p begin="01:35.937" end="01:37.068" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37371">Your hands</p><p begin="01:37.078" end="01:39.509" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37372">Too long since I've been a fool<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我已像个傻瓜般对你深深眷恋</span></p><p begin="01:40.102" end="01:42.145" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37373">Oh, yeah</p><p begin="01:42.366" end="01:44.666" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37374">Leave this blue neighborhood<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多想离开这痛苦的悲伤之地</span></p><p begin="01:44.676" end="01:47.364" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37375">Never knew loving could hurt this good, oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从不知爱会让人如此受伤</span></p><p begin="01:48.146" end="01:50.015" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37376">And it drives me wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它让我失去理智 全然疯狂</span></p><p begin="01:52.429" end="01:54.745" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37377">'Cause when you look like that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为当你是那般模样时</span></p><p begin="01:54.755" end="01:57.709" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37378">I've never ever wanted to be so bad, oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心对你燃起从未有过的渴望</span></p><p begin="01:58.205" end="02:00.437" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37379">Yeah, it drives me wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它让我失去理智 全然疯狂</span></p><p begin="02:01.675" end="02:05.445" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37380">You're driving me wild, wild, wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我失去理智 为你疯狂</span></p><p begin="02:06.616" end="02:11.035" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37381">You're driving me wild, wild, wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我失去理智 为你疯狂</span></p><p begin="02:11.683" end="02:15.779" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37382">You're driving me wild, wild, wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我失去理智 为你疯狂</span></p><p begin="02:16.765" end="02:21.301" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37383">You're driving me wild, wild, wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我失去理智 为你疯狂</span></p><p begin="02:21.818" end="02:24.163" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37384">You make my heart shake<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我的心颤抖不已</span></p><p begin="02:24.173" end="02:25.305" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37385">Bend and break<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">破碎支离</span></p><p begin="02:25.315" end="02:27.030" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37386">But I can't turn away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而我仍是无法抗拒</span></p><p begin="02:27.040" end="02:28.933" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37387">And it's driving me wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的魅力让我为之疯狂</span></p><p begin="02:29.640" end="02:31.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37388">You're driving me wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我失去理智</span></p><p begin="02:32.005" end="02:34.347" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37389">You make my heart shake<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我的心</span></p><p begin="02:34.357" end="02:35.534" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37390">Bend and break<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">破碎支离</span></p><p begin="02:35.544" end="02:37.030" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37391">But I can't turn away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而我仍是无法抗拒</span></p><p begin="02:37.040" end="02:39.208" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37392">And it's driving me wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的魅力让我为之疯狂</span></p><p begin="02:39.885" end="02:42.176" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37393">You're driving me wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我失去理智</span></p><p begin="02:43.626" end="02:45.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37394">Leave this blue neighborhood<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多想离开这痛苦的悲伤之地</span></p><p begin="02:45.940" end="02:48.738" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37395">Never knew loving could hurt this good, oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从不知爱会让人如此受伤</span></p><p begin="02:49.196" end="02:51.463" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37396">And it drives me wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它让我失去理智</span></p><p begin="02:53.663" end="02:55.944" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37397">'Cause when you look like that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为当你是那般模样时</span></p><p begin="02:55.954" end="02:58.922" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37398">I've never ever wanted to be so bad, oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心对你燃起从未有过的渴望</span></p><p begin="02:59.522" end="03:01.751" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37399">And it drives me wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它让我失去理智 全然疯狂</span></p><p begin="03:02.810" end="03:06.573" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37400">You're driving me wild, wild, wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我失去理智 为你疯狂</span></p><p begin="03:07.948" end="03:12.271" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37401">You're driving me wild, wild, wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我失去理智 为你疯狂</span></p><p begin="03:12.839" end="03:16.999" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37402">You're driving me wild, wild, wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我失去理智 为你疯狂</span></p><p begin="03:17.834" end="03:22.431" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37403">You're driving me wild, wild, wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我失去理智 为你疯狂</span></p><p begin="03:22.703" end="03:24.674" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37404">You're driving me wild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我失去理智</span></p><p begin="03:24.281" end="03:26.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37405">(Wi-i-i-ild<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为你疯狂</span></p><p begin="03:26.707" end="03:28.745" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37406">Wi-i-i-ild</p><p begin="03:29.230" end="03:31.145" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37407">Wi-i-i-ild</p><p begin="03:31.155" end="03:31.872" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37408">Hey)</p></div></body></tt>